    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@value": "The role/office of Kumari (living-goddess embodiment) that a person assumes for the duration of a KumariTenure. The role is the type; the tenure is the time-bounded holding of it; the person is the holder."
